+0 bind(3, ..., ...) = 0
+0 listen(3, 1) = 0

+0 < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0 > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 46720 <mss 1460>
+0 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0 accept(3, ..., ...) = 4

+0 < P. 1:1001(1000) ack 1 win 65535
+0 > . 1:1(0) ack 1001 win 45720
+0 < P. 1:1001(1000) ack 1 win 65535
+0 > . 1:1(0) ack 1001 win 45720
+0 read(4, ..., 2000) = 1000
+0 > . 1:1(0) ack 1001 win 46720
